     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet nmdp-ethnicity-codes</b></p><a name=\"nmdp-ethnicity-codes\"> </a><a name=\"hcnmdp-ethnicity-codes\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include all codes defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-nmdp-ethnicity-cs.html\"><code>http://terminology.nmdp.org/codesystem/ethnicity</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.1.4</span></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/us/core/STU4/CodeSystem-cdcrec.html\"><code>urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.6.238</code></a><span title=\"Version is explicitly stated to be 4.0.0\"> version ?4.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/us/core/STU4/CodeSystem-cdcrec.html#cdcrec-2135-2\">2135-2</a></td><td>Hispanic or latino</td><td>Hispanic or Latino</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/us/core/STU4/CodeSystem-cdcrec.html#cdcrec-2186-5\">2186-5</a></td><td>Not Hispanic or latino</td><td>Note that this term remains in the table for completeness, even though within HL7, the notion of \"not otherwise coded\" term is deprecated.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/us/core/STU4/CodeSystem-cdcrec.html#cdcrec-E1.4601\">E1.01</a></td><td>Spaniard</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/us/core/STU4/CodeSystem-cdcrec.html#cdcrec-E1.4601.46001\">E1.01.001</a></td><td>Andalusian</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/us/core/STU4/CodeSystem-cdcrec.html#cdcrec-E1.4601.46002\">E1.01.002</a></td><td>Asturian</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/us/core/STU4/CodeSystem-cdcrec.html#cdcrec-E1.4601.46003\">E1.01.003</a></td><td>Castillian</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http:/